{
  "info": {
    "name": "AeroTiquetes - Usuarios, Compras y Billetera (B1)",
    "description": "Auth, perfil, administradores, compra/reserva y gestion financiera. Root solo crea administradores y gestiona su propio perfil (no hay gestion de roles). Orden sugerido: 1) Login root, 2) Registro de cliente, 3) Login cliente, 4) Billetera y tarjetas (agregar saldo), 5) Compra y reserva: pegar en la variable {{vueloId}} el id de un vuelo (GET /vuelos) y probar reservar, pagar reserva, comprar, historial y cancelar.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "rootId",
      "value": "root"
    },
    {
      "key": "rootPassword",
      "value": "CAMBIAR_POR_TU_ROOT_PASSWORD_DEL_.env"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "vueloId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "vueloRegresoId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "reservaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "compraId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tiqueteId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tarjetaId",
      "value": ""
